      <title>余杭区斥资3.12亿元密集采购AI教育服务</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260902/%E4%BD%99%E6%9D%AD%E5%8C%BA%E6%96%A5%E8%B5%843.12%E4%BA%BF%E5%85%83%E5%AF%86%E9%9B%86%E9%87%87%E8%B4%ADAI%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1/</link>
